Homepage: https://github.com/SECTL/SecRandom-Lite
Description: random roll-call application for classrooms
 SecRandom Lite is a Material Design 3 random roll-call and student picker
 for classroom use. It supports student lists, several fair-draw modes,
 roll-call history, data import/export, and optional cloud sync.
